[shake rate=20 level=10]Your heart pounds as your entire body begins to shake.[/shake] [ID:461A36_16B9E6]

 The beast lunges toward the glowing being, trying to seize it. The creature narrowly escapes and flies straight toward you. [ID:461A36_41E160]

???: Run!!! [ID:461A36_81F525]

The two of you sprint back toward the road. You rush inside your house in a panic, only to realize the glowing being has followed you. [ID:461A36_115F42]
do SceneController.hide_character("Sprite3")
do SceneController.fade_to_black()
do SceneController.change_background("res://Visual Novel Romance/files/fundo-branco-png.png")

{{GameData.player_name}}: This has to be some kind of nightmare... Or maybe I'm losing my mind. [ID:461A36_099151]

???: Thank you for giving me shelter, Dreamer. [ID:461A36_4575A2]

{{GameData.player_name}}: ... [ID:461A36_E4174F]

{{GameData.player_name}}: By the Goddess... WHAT WAS THAT?! [ID:461A36_40B9EE]

???: My name is Ello. [ID:461A36_749EEF]

Ello: I am a guardian of dreams. My duty is to protect the dreams of every living soul. [ID:461A36_C5840B]

Ello: I was watching over people's dreams, but little by little... there were fewer dreams left to protect. [ID:461A36_7EEF01]

Ello: So I decided to come here, hoping I could help restore people's dreams. But unfortunately, the nightmares had the same idea. [ID:461A36_868355]

Ello: The beasts born from nightmares have taken physical form. [ID:461A36_618F52]

{{GameData.player_name}}: Wait... You mean like the stories I used to hear when I was a kid? [ID:461A36_DC7E30]

Ello: I suppose so. Every culture has its own way of describing the beings who watch over dreams. [ID:461A36_E0DF49]

Ello: The beast chasing me wanted my powers. It won't stop until it devours every dream that's left. [ID:461A36_EB7D96]

Ello: I think we're safe here. Those creatures thrive in darkness. It's easier for them to twist what people see, filling the living with fear before tormenting them in their nightmares. [ID:461A36_9B61BC]

Ello: I'm worried about the animals still trapped in the forest... [ID:461A36_8AB45E]

{{GameData.player_name}}: [shake rate=10 level=5] What about my cat?! Is Felix in danger? What am I supposed to do?![/shake] [ID:461A36_646633]

Ello: I don't think we should return to the forest. It's far too dangerous. [ID:461A36_FA19BE]

Ello: I can try to protect his dreams. If I succeed, he'll be safe for now [ID:461A36_6645BF]

{{GameData.player_name}}: I don't know... What's the worst that beast could do? [ID:461A36_5EC3CA]

Ello: ... [ID:461A36_8AE9C4]

Ello: It could corrupt what remains of this world, driving everyone into madness through endless nightmares [ID:461A36_BD7667]

Ello: I need to rest. Nearly being devoured isn't exactly easy to recover from [ID:461A36_0069A6]

Ello settles down to rest in the living room [ID:461A36_268F9D]

do SceneController.hide_character("Sprite5")
do SceneController.fade_to_black()
do SceneController.change_background("res://Visual Novel Romance/files/room1.png")

