{{GameData.player_name}}: Huh... What was that? [ID:461A36_DB75CE]
{{GameData.player_name}}: It's been so long since I last dreamed, and then that monster shows up [ID:461A36_073DF4]

Ello: It was intentional. They wanted to leave you with little lucidity so you'd be easier to manipulate [ID:461A36_E84BD5]

{{GameData.player_name}}: By the Goddess... How can I get rid of this? [ID:461A36_F350BC]

Ello: ...Well, I don't think it's wise to stop dreaming. The ideal is to find yourself within the dream, avoiding moments of vulnerability [ID:461A36_620E64]

{{GameData.player_name}}: Find myself? Like one of those church sermons? [ID:461A36_747BC7]

Ello: Something like that, but it's not time for that yet... [ID:461A36_0F0046]

{{GameData.player_name}}: What about my Felix? Do you think he's okay? [ID:461A36_9C1BB6]

Ello: From what I've been able to monitor, he's doing as well as can be expected [ID:461A36_A170AD]

{{GameData.player_name}}: But how can you be so sure? This is all so bizarre [ID:461A36_C5B539]

Ello: It's a secret [ID:461A36_30CD6B]

