~ myth 
do SceneController.show_character("Sprite1")
{{GameData.player_name}}: I'm more or less... [ID:461A36_609140]
{{GameData.player_name}}: Wow, that's crazy, what are you thinking about your research? [ID:461A36_DAE2C8]

Gio: I actually love this subject, when I was younger it wasn't as exciting, but now I can compare different sources [ID:461A36_86E892]

Gio: There are other mythologies that I intend to study in depth, but for now I'll focus on this one [ID:461A36_2B80EF]

Gio: A lot of things get summarized when we go to a service, and even though they give you a foundation, I don't think it's enough for me, I want to know more [ID:461A36_9C32DE]

Gio: Have you heard any news? [ID:461A36_5D9364]

