~ tell 
do SceneController.show_character("Sprite1")
do SaveManager.set_checkpoint("tell")
{{GameData.player_name}}: You won't believe this... Felix ran away, and when I went looking for him, I ended up finding a dream guardian [ID:461A36_A49009]

{{GameData.player_name}}: This is crazy [ID:461A36_A25C08]

Gio: What? Wait, that was a lot to take in all at once [ID:461A36_BF76ED]

Gio: I didn't expect the prophecy to have already begun... It was only speculation [ID:461A36_14C8EA]

Gio: This means we haven't been alone for some time [ID:461A36_05C1D4]

Gio becomes thoughtful, his expression growing somewhat serious [ID:461A36_886A44]

- Ask questions [ID:461A36_5F223E]
  => ask

~ ask
do SceneController.show_character("Sprite1")
{{GameData.player_name}}: What does all of this mean? [ID:461A36_E36402]

Gio: So... this means that people in general no longer dream, but despite that, they are still susceptible to the influence of nightmares [ID:461A36_1C348C]

Gio: Because of this, the guardians have lost a large part of their strength, which came from the vitality of human dreams [ID:461A36_3D1A18]

Gio: All of this is quite surprising... It's a process of metamorphosis [ID:461A36_B7B1EF]

{{GameData.player_name}}: Huh?? [ID:461A36_496ABA]

Gio: How can I put this... It's a change expected in a possible future. It's not predetermined, but it does have certain tendencies [ID:461A36_0EF3B9]

Gio: The prophecy indicates that the future has two main paths. In one, it is possible to restore people's dreams through the intervention of the guardians, while the other happens if the guardians' intervention fails [ID:461A36_EFD928]

Gio: The guardians' intervention must be indirect and cautious, because they need to guide people toward understanding who they are, discovering and rediscovering their forgotten dreams [ID:461A36_B76854]

Gio: From there, they will begin to dream more often and in a healthier way, because they will understand that what lies hidden within them can only be safely controlled by understanding who they are, meaning the nightmares' attacks will no longer have any effect [ID:461A36_BEA30B]

{{GameData.player_name}}: ...And what if they fail? [ID:461A36_533B2F]

Gio: It is very likely that people will begin to experience nightmares so real and intense that they will start confusing reality with their nightmares [ID:461A36_13D45F]

Gio: They will become aggressive and unrecognizable, because they will see nothing but distortions [ID:461A36_9F8CCF]

Gio: We can continue this later, we should get to class [ID:461A36_058EAB]

You go to your classroom and remain thoughtful about the new information you have learned. You pay attention during the university classes from time to time [ID:461A36_8D8A90]

You wonder if you will meet Gio after class [ID:461A36_1DBE86]

After hours of studying, you find yourself ready to leave [ID:461A36_43BB11]

=> go_work2

~ not_tell
do SaveManager.set_checkpoint("not_tell")
do SceneController.show_character("Sprite1")
{{GameData.player_name}}: I just had a terrible night... My cat ran away, and I still haven't found him [ID:461A36_CA9447]

Gio: Oh... That's sad. You'll find him soon, I'm sure of it [ID:461A36_73BEEA]

Gio: So, how did this happen? [ID:461A36_3F22C0]

{{GameData.player_name}}: To tell you the truth, I don't even know... I was opening the door to get inside my house when my key fell to the floor, and during that time Felix, who was near the door, ran outside [ID:461A36_AB6C53]

Gio: I hope he's okay [ID:461A36_D012EB]

{{GameData.player_name}}: Me too [ID:461A36_B1D203]

{{GameData.player_name}}: Let's change the subject for a bit... Give my mind a chance to relax [ID:461A36_2CE406]

{{GameData.player_name}}: You said you had discovered something new. What was it? [ID:461A36_6CA399]

Gio: I can tell you're interested in my research [ID:461A36_C41F23]

Gio: Well... There are several curiosities and mysteries surrounding these mystical beings [ID:461A36_C91752]

Gio: Nightmares are frequently associated with large animals, creating a sense of helplessness and terror, neutralizing their targets without much effort [ID:461A36_A654CD]

Gio: Meanwhile, dream beings are often represented as small, bright, flying creatures [ID:461A36_8C952C]

Gio: But it's funny how humans are sometimes represented as both, to suggest that deep down, we are the evil we fear and the good we desire [ID:461A36_224677]

Gio: Stories always try to convey the idea that you should prioritize who you are over the person others expect you to be [ID:461A36_31B41C]

Gio: The complete opposite of nightmares, which try at all costs to make you lose yourself [ID:461A36_C148AA]

Gio: Dreams reveal a great deal about who you are, including what you think and feel [ID:461A36_8501DF]

{{GameData.player_name}}: Hmmm... So what would it mean to dream about guardians and beasts? [ID:461A36_77219D]

Gio: I'm not an expert in the field... but I would assume it indicates some kind of conflict. I'm not certain, though. It depends a lot on what the dream was like [ID:461A36_A7745A]

{{GameData.player_name}}: Ah... I see. That's really interesting, but I think it's time for class to start [ID:461A36_0A26E3]

Gio: True. See you later [ID:461A36_073207]

You say goodbye and go to your respective classrooms. You wonder if you should have told him, but you're afraid of what it might trigger [ID:461A36_DC6EA3]

You try to remember the church's commandments, hoping to find something that might help you, but you can't remember much [ID:461A36_879393]

You wonder if you should talk to Ello to figure out how to deal with this [ID:461A36_DBC674]

You struggle to focus on the class material because you don't want to fail the subject, so you take notes and draw to help with your thought process [ID:461A36_331778]

After class, you head straight to work. On the way, you run into Mary [ID:461A36_5DBA30]

Mary asks how you are doing, and you briefly explain the situation. She sympathizes with you and says she'll give you a cat collar with a tracker to save you the trouble [ID:461A36_16EDEB]

Mary tells you about the latest news from her job and how well she's been doing at university this semester, although she still doesn't have much time to have fun [ID:461A36_AA15EB]

