{{GameData.player_name}}: Sister, how do I know if my dream is a good one? [ID:461A36_FC7D80]

Sister: When it brings you peace and fulfillment, you'll know you're on the right path. [ID:461A36_D5F3FD]

{{GameData.player_name}}: What if I want to be so many things? Can I become anything I want? [ID:461A36_E5695A]

Sister: You might have a passion for many things, but try to focus on one at a time—otherwise, you might end up lost. [ID:461A36_417875]

Sister: Life is about making choices on what truly matters. Sometimes we have to hold onto certain things and let others go. [ID:461A36_52F864]

{{GameData.player_name}}: So, Sister... what dream did you choose? [ID:461A36_7685F3]

Sister: To build a happy family. Growing up wasn't easy for us, so nothing mattered more to me than creating a place we could truly call home. [ID:461A36_2CFF94]

Sister: And now that dream is coming true—I have all of you, my family, right here with me. [ID:461A36_C1B1AC]

{{GameData.player_name}}: And what do you do once your dream comes true? [ID:461A36_6D78D6]

Sister: Now? Now I get to help the rest of my family achieve theirs. [ID:461A36_130BC1]

